WEBVTT

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.170
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.950
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.280
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.120
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.820
With you guys

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.820
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:49.490
If we join forces

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:52.460
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:55.800
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:02.970
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:09.110
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.180
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.120
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:17.260
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:22.430
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:25.430
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:29.130
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:33.170
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:36.040
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:40.040
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.250
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:49.950
Someone once said...

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:54.660
There are canola flowers 
with leaves of fragrant,

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:57.100
first-rate naan,

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:00.330
cooked to a beautiful brown by canola oil...

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:04.940
Canaana!

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:20.220
There are top-quality almonds

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:24.160
that sparkle beautifully like sapphires...

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:29.460
Sapphalmonds!

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:34.600
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:40.640
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:47.480
W-What is that?

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:50.250
Hey! What the hell is this?!

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:56.390
The people caught in the Green Rain, 
poisonous rain produced by the Four-Beasts,

00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:58.490
only have a short time left to live.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.590
I swear I'll succeed!

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:05.360
Toriko-san and the others are 
in a desperate battle too!

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:13.270
Amazing...

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:15.270
That's...

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:23.850
Everyone, please start 
making the Medicinal Mochi.

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:27.120
Unfortunately, we'll have to decide 
who's going to be able to eat it.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.140
I did it!

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:50.810
I found a simple way to make

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:52.510
Medicinal Mochi!

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:55.180
In the allotted ten minutes, 
Komatsu brilliantly discovered

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:59.680
a simplified way to make Medicinal 
Mochi, which will be used

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:01.750
to nullify the Green Rain's poison.

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:08.290
Toriko-san! Coco-san! Sunny-san! Zebra-san!

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.660
I think we're going to get through this here!

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:14.100
You guys please take care of the Four-Beasts!

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:21.070
However, against the Four-Beasts' 
overwhelming strength,

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:25.180
the Four Kings are driven into a corner!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:53.470
Burst! Curiosity about the Flavor! 
The Four Kings' Combined Skill!

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:02.980
Toriko-san!

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:04.480
Coco-san!

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:06.320
Sunny-san!

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:08.650
Zebra-san!

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:20.530
T-This doesn't look good...

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:22.330
It's too strong!

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:26.740
We may actually die...

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:27.970
...this time...

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:32.710
Gotta be a way to kill it...

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:34.980
The problem is...

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.110
Zebra!

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:44.220
...the poison from this rain is 
already circulating through my body.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:48.590
Coco, can't you make 
antibodies for this crap?

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:51.660
It's Gourmet World poison.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:54.300
I'm analyzing its components,

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.500
but I can't seem to crack it.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:00.770
I guess...

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:03.940
...we'd better steel ourselves.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:28.630
Toriko...

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:32.000
Bastard... At a time like this...

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:35.470
...you don't let vulgar noises 
come out of your stomach!

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:38.340
Sorry. Whoops.

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:41.050
I was just thinkin' of the old man's message

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:43.480
that Rin passed on.

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:46.450
At the end of it, the old man

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:49.920
apparently touched on the Four-Beasts' taste.

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:52.220
The Four-Beasts' taste?

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:53.120
Yeah.

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:57.860
When damage is done to the 
Four-Beasts' main body,

00:06:57.860 --> 00:07:01.930
the impact flows through the body and 
is discharged outside of the body.

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:06.470
But when that happens, a certain 
amino acid is produced.

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:10.240
This amplifies the flavor of the meat,

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:13.310
which also becomes mellower 
the more impacts there are.

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:16.050
In other words,

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:18.880
the more damage you do,

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:20.990
the tastier the Four-Beasts becomes.

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:24.060
That's what I heard!

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:39.200
Yeesh. What's that about flavor?!

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:43.070
Is that something you talk about 
when we may be at death's door?!

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:50.780
We did...

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:54.150
...deal it quite a bit of damage, didn't we?

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:57.590
Yeah. A lot.

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:01.690
My guess is it's not just meat,

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:06.860
but also the condensed deliciousness of 
every vegetable and fruit in the ground!

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:10.570
It's like the ultimate hamburger!

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:16.370
What kind of sound was that, Zebra?!

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.780
You can't talk, Sunny. Yours was vulgar too.

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:27.350
Even if we're all at the point of 
dyin', our stomachs are honest!

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.060
I bet it's delicious...

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.220
It's been a long time

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:35.560
since my stomach has rumbled.

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:38.600
I wanna eat

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:40.730
that thing's meat!

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:44.470
Where's its tastiest meat?

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.040
I'm gonna eat that part first!

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:48.540
I'll save the best for last.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.540
Who gives a damn about <i>how</i> you eat it?

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:55.050
What's important is that we 
enjoy eating the whole thing!

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:00.350
It's always been like this for us.

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:03.790
The one thing that makes us buckle down

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:05.260
has always been

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:09.030
curiosity about flavor!

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:13.360
Let's eat this thing!

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.640
Fork Shield!

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:27.710
But what should we do?!

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:31.050
Good question. Soon as 
we hit it with a skill,

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.850
the damage is carried right outside its body!

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:37.990
And the Green Rain's poison 
is circulating in our bodies.

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:40.460
On top of that, we've used up our strength.

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:43.760
So we'd better find a way 
to take it down quickly.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.970
Jet Voice... Cripes!

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:24.270
It's like I'm babysittin' you dummies!

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:26.340
Much appreciated, Zebra.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:32.480
More importantly, I think there's 
a simple way to kill it!

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:38.550
All we gotta do is give that behemoth 
a ton of damage all at once

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:41.690
so its body can't pass the impact along.

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:44.620
Zebra, that's preposterous!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:47.190
We don't have that kind of power right now!

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:49.160
We may be able to muster it with <i>that</i>.

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:58.000
We never got it to work 
during our training days,

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.470
but it's the combined 
skill of the four of us...

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.740
The one the President taught us...

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:03.640
The secret technique...

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:09.650
This is our last hope to 
bring down the Four-Beasts.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:11.580
But the risk is high.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:13.750
It takes time to unleash the skill.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:16.590
Yeah, to build up power...

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:19.120
And also, if our appetites

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:23.760
an' spirits aren't perfectly 
in sync, it ain't gonna work.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:26.530
You're always the one who's 
the most out of sync!

00:11:30.170 --> 00:11:31.100
Here it comes!

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.250
I lost my voice...

00:11:53.890 --> 00:11:55.590
Terry!

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:01.470
Queen!

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:05.140
Kiss!

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:14.010
Terry and the others are 
gonna buy us some time!

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:16.450
And we'll use it to build up power!

00:12:21.890 --> 00:12:23.290
Let's show 'em

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:27.060
the strongest technique of the Four Kings!

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:52.580
I sense it...

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.570
This is appetite energy.

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:12.540
Appetite energy?!

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:14.040
That's right.

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:19.480
It's a unique energy only the strongest 
predators at the top of the food chain

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:24.050
can produce from their Gourmet Cells.

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:30.250
This powerful energy, which can mow 
down and devour any ingredient,

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:32.960
won't appear with any ordinary appetite.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.460
The way I see it,

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.730
you four put together have 
the appetite of one person.

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:43.000
Toriko...

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:47.440
Coco...

00:13:50.340 --> 00:13:51.880
Sunny...

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:55.750
Zebra...

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:59.220
Combine your strength,

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:02.820
get your appetites in sync, 
and try to produce it!

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:09.360
Concentrate!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:13.730
Let's get our appetites in sync!

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.780
The Four-Beasts...

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:05.280
It seems to be recalling...

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:10.760
...memories of the ancient Gourmet World...

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.690
The thousands of battles it's been through...

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:18.200
Terry and the others definitely

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:20.800
don't mean to just buy time here.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:24.240
They aim to kill it.

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:29.270
And the Four-Beasts itself is trying 
to crush them with all of its strength.

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:10.880
Focus more!

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:14.190
You guys...

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:16.590
...ain't got enough appetite!

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:24.660
There!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.100
It's hot!

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:30.800
Incredible energy!

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:32.570
We're not done!

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:34.910
This tiny energy

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:36.770
won't be able to eat that thing!

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:43.050
You guys ain't got nearly enough appetite!

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:44.650
Keep up with me!

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:45.950
What are you talking about?!

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:48.290
Me! Match my appetite!

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:58.560
We failed!

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.200
Seriously?!

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:03.800
One more time!

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.190
Again?!

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:02.090
Build up more appetite!

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:06.300
At this level, it's just 
gonna disappear again!

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:46.440
F-Four-Beasts...

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:49.210
I wanna...

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:53.340
I wanna eat the Four-Beasts...

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:11.830
I wanna eat it...

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:24.740
Sorry we took so long,

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:27.170
Terry, Kiss, Queen...

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:30.210
...and Four-Beasts!

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:31.910
You'll wanna see this.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.650
This is our...

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:36.310
...appetite!

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:40.550
Energy that craves you

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:44.320
versus your appetite. Which 
will come out on top?

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:53.700
Shall we have a showdown?

00:20:54.430 --> 00:20:57.400
The winner will indisputably be

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:58.970
...the predator!

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:08.510
I have been alone

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:15.920
Ever since that day

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:23.560
All I got was a definite history

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:30.270
But tomorrow is still, still, 
still just an uncertain dream

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:33.640
It’s like a tautology, logy

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:37.110
This is a tautology, logy

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:41.180
A dream is still a dream

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:44.480
Not gonna wake up, logy, logy

00:21:44.550 --> 00:21:48.920
Right now, we’re lookin’ at

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:52.620
What it is we're lookin' at

00:21:52.790 --> 00:22:00.430
The thing we’re lookin’ 
at ain’t no illusion

00:22:03.030 --> 00:22:06.070
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:06.470 --> 00:22:10.580
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:13.750
Hiding Level 6

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:13.750
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 6!

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:16.510
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:16.510 --> 00:22:19.580
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:22.350
Alright, today's location 
is the Gourmet Shrine.

00:22:22.350 --> 00:22:24.620
It's as lively as always!

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:26.690
The food from the stands looks delicious!

00:22:26.690 --> 00:22:29.760
Alright, where is Yun?

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:32.730
Yun is... right here!

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:38.540
Well?

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:42.770
It's been a while, maybe I'll go to the 
Gourmet Shrine to raise my Gourmet Luck.

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:46.140
If my Gourmet Luck increases, things 
should go well with my work.

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:49.110
And now on to the next segment!

00:22:52.130 --> 00:22:53.830
Will the Four-Beasts survive?

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:55.410
Or humanity?

00:22:55.630 --> 00:22:58.840
It's eat or be eaten! Who really rules the food chain?

00:22:59.580 --> 00:23:01.850
Secret Technique: Meal Fit for a King

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:03.660
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
